    "clarity": "The proposal provides a well-defined workflow detailing how hidden states are extracted from the critic agent, mapped via a discrete trigger, and coupled with prompt templates or contrastive constraints.",
    "importance": "Addressing the tendency of language models to generate mediocre, conventional ideas is crucial for unlocking the utility of automated scientific ideation tools.",
    "evidence_grounding": "The literature accurately reflects prior work on multi-agent frameworks, literature-grounded novelty checking, and evaluation benchmarks."
